# Patterns without a leading **/ match the context root only — build
# artifacts and env files must be excluded at every level of the monorepo
# (e.g. packages/backend/dist), otherwise stale local output leaks into
# the image and shadows freshly built files (e.g. renamed migrations).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
.git
**/.env*
*.log
.specify
.devin
researches
specs
AGENTS.md
README.md
